C03: a bare video after «abre youtube» is asked for and then played (VIDEO1717)

«abre youtube y pon un video» (H0141) reached no operation and no clarification: the incomplete-media clarification («poneme una canción», MUSIC1571) required a music noun and did not admit the compound with «abre youtube». A video asked for without saying which is now as incomplete as an unnamed song (the clause admits «video/videos» and the head «abre … youtube y pon …»), unless the video is already named («un video de lofi en youtube») or the title is on a streaming service (Prime Video, Disney+, Netflix… stay outside); the first turn asks which video without operating, and the answer is read as «pon un video de <answer> en youtube», so it resolves to the reviewed YouTube playback in the local player.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


